  lines:
  - name: ...
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
    text: (Ascending the light house seems like a second nature to you now.)
  - name: ...
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
    text: (You have been follow along the only lead you have, thinking that this
      is the only option.)
  - name: ...
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
    text: (Is this... your only option?)
  - name: ...
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
    text: (Or is this even the right choice?)
